[block
  'ORD-0010-classify'
  [ctx
    'the spec of EMS-002'
    '.guidelines/.orders/EMS-002/EMS-002.pgml'
  [/ctx]
  [tgt
    'classify answered by the page from the tables it loads, question 10 of the EMS-001 return, answered c'
  [/tgt]
  [ctx
    'behind engine=relay the transport swaps the twelve calls, one request each, and a keystroke on L-01 makes 8 005 of them, one classify a command token'
  [/ctx]
  [cnst
    'the transport stops swapping classify, and the page answers it with the JS core and the tables glyph-data.js loads; the other eleven stay one request each'
  [/cnst]
  [cnst
    'the browser that measures it is an instrument outside the repository, since the JS side has no dependency; the suite holds what node can hold, the swap set'
  [/cnst]
  [cmp
    'the requests'
    'behind engine=relay, every call but classify is one request, and classify is answered by the page; L-01 stops making 8 000 trips'
    [ctx[/ctx]
    [cnst[/cnst]
  [/cmp]
